  "productId": 915293,
  "context": {
    "product": {
      "id": 915293,
      "name": "Cauliflower",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower has many health benefits, including:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Digestion:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">A medium head of cauliflower contains almost 12 grams of fiber, which can help with digestion, bowel regularity, and feeding beneficial gut bacteria. Fiber can also slow digestion, which can help you feel full longer.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Weight loss:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower is low in calories, with only 25 calories per cup, and it's also high in water.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Antioxidants:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower contains high levels of antioxidants and anti-inflammatory compounds, which can help prevent diseases like cancer, heart disease, and brain disease.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Immunity:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vitamin C in cauliflower can help protect the body from infection and reduce inflammation that can cause disease.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Brain health:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower contains choline, a B vitamin that can help improve memory and learning by boosting cognitive function.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bone health:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower contains vitamin C, which helps produce collagen to protect bones and joints from inflammation, and vitamin K, which can help prevent bone loss.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cardiovascular disease:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower contains anti-inflammatory agents and minerals like zinc and potassium, which can help remove plaque from blood vessels and improve blood circulation, which can reduce the risk of cardiovascular disease.</span></p>",
